  "ContentData": {
    "ContentBlocks": [
      {
        "type": "Hero",
        "content": {
          "type": "Main",
          "headline": "Request an Ice Rink Rental Quote",
          "subheadline": "Tell us where, when, and how the rink will be used so the next conversation can focus on availability, setup fit, and scope.",
          "backgroundImage": "",
          "backgroundImageAltText": "",
          "mainImage": "",
          "mainImageAltText": "Ice rink rental quote request",
          "buttonText": "Start Quote Request",
          "buttonLink": "#contact",
          "secondaryButtonText": "Review Service Areas",
          "secondaryButtonLink": "/service-areas"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "customHtml",
        "content": {
          "id": "contact-quote-context",
          "label": "Quote request context panel",
          "container": "wide",
          "allowedProfile": "layout-rich",
          "sectionVariant": "quote-form-panel",
          "sanitize": true,
          "html": "<section class=\"cms-layout ice-quote-grid\"><div><p class=\"cms-eyebrow\">Quote request</p><h2>The best first message is specific, not technical.</h2><p>You do not need to know the final rink size before reaching out. Share the event basics and any known venue constraints so the rental fit can be reviewed.</p></div><aside class=\"cms-panel\"><h3>Include these details</h3><ul class=\"ice-details-list\"><li>Event date or date range</li><li>City, state, venue, and surface type</li><li>Indoor, outdoor, covered, or exposed setup</li><li>Expected attendance and operating hours</li><li>Access, loading, setup, and teardown notes</li></ul></aside></section>",
          "css": "[data-section-id='contact-quote-context'] .ice-quote-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 2rem; padding: 2rem; background: var(--cms-backgrounds-frost); border-radius: var(--cms-border-radius-card); }\n[data-section-id='contact-quote-context'] .cms-eyebrow { color: var(--cms-colors-primary); font-weight: 700; }\n[data-section-id='contact-quote-context'] .ice-details-list { display: grid; gap: 0.5rem; padding-left: 1rem; }",
          "review": {
            "status": "needs_human_review",
            "notes": "No raw form markup; structured Contact block below owns fields and endpoint metadata."
          },
          "validation": {
            "expected": "no blocking errors"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "formBlock",
        "content": {
          "id": "contact-quote-form",
          "label": "Ice quote request form",
          "formKey": "default-quote-request",
          "variant": "quote-form-panel",
          "heading": "Request a portable ice rink rental quote",
          "intro": "Share the event city, state, date range, venue setting, expected attendance, and planning notes so the request can be reviewed for fit and follow-up.",
          "submitLabel": "Submit Quote Request",
          "successMessage": "Thanks. Your ice rink rental request has been received for review.",
          "errorMessage": "Unable to submit this quote request right now. Please try again.",
          "staticEndpointRef": "ICE_RINK_RENTALS_STATIC_CONTACT_ENDPOINT",
          "leadRecipientRef": "ICE_RINK_RENTALS_LEAD_RECIPIENT",
          "sourcePage": "/contact",
          "review": {
            "status": "needs_human_review",
            "notes": "Visible structured formBlock. No raw form/input/button HTML is stored in customHtml."
          },
          "validation": {
            "expected": "visible default-quote-request formBlock with non-secret endpoint and lead recipient refs"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "customHtml",
        "content": {
          "id": "contact-response-expectations",
          "label": "Response and privacy expectations",
          "container": "standard",
          "allowedProfile": "marketing-rich",
          "sectionVariant": "trust-band",
          "sanitize": true,
          "html": "<section class=\"cms-copy ice-response-note\"><h2>What happens after you send the request</h2><p>The review team should use your details to understand timing, location, venue fit, and the next planning questions. Final response timing, lead routing, and email behavior must be approved before production.</p><blockquote class=\"ice-privacy-note\">Privacy note: contact details should only be used to respond to the submitted rink rental inquiry and should not expose private routing information in public page code.</blockquote></section>",
          "css": "[data-section-id='contact-response-expectations'] .ice-response-note { padding: 1.5rem; background: var(--cms-colors-surface); border: 1px solid var(--cms-colors-border); border-radius: var(--cms-border-radius-card); }\n[data-section-id='contact-response-expectations'] .ice-privacy-note { color: var(--cms-colors-muted); }",
          "review": {
            "status": "needs_human_review"
          },
          "validation": {
            "expected": "no blocking errors"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "FAQ",
        "content": {
          "title": "Quote request questions",
          "subtitle": "These answers keep the form focused and realistic.",
          "layout": "accordion",
          "items": [
            {
              "question": "Can I request a quote before every detail is final?",
              "answer": "Yes. Share the details you have now, especially date, location, venue type, guest count, and surface notes. The scope can be refined during follow-up."
            },
            {
              "question": "What information helps most?",
              "answer": "Date range, operating hours, venue address, indoor or outdoor placement, surface type, access, expected attendance, and add-on needs are the most useful first details."
            },
            {
              "question": "Will this form send to a real inbox yet?",
              "answer": "Not until the production static form endpoint and lead recipient reference are approved. This template intentionally uses non-secret placeholders."
            },
            {
              "question": "Can I ask about service in my city?",
              "answer": "Yes. Include your city and state. Final availability should be confirmed through quote review rather than assumed from a public page."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "PrimaryCTA",
        "content": {
          "title": "Have your event details ready?",
          "description": "Use the quote form to send the date, location, venue type, and goals for review.",
          "buttonText": "Start Quote Request",
          "buttonLink": "#contact",
          "secondaryText": "Checking coverage first?",
          "secondaryLinkText": "View Service Areas",
          "secondaryLink": "/service-areas",
          "backgroundImage": "",
          "mainImage": "",
          "alt": "Start an ice rink rental quote request"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
